WEBVTT

00:04:28.991 --> 00:04:33.776
When a secret agent virus
infects a bacterium,

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.562
they do a little espionage.

00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:40.336
Here, this cloaked, secret agent virus

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:43.123
is slipping his DNA
into the bacterial cell,

00:04:43.147 --> 00:04:44.742
but here's the kicker:

00:04:44.766 --> 00:04:48.639
It doesn't do anything
harmful -- not at first.

00:04:49.043 --> 00:04:54.598
Instead, it silently slips
into the bacteria's own DNA,

00:04:54.622 --> 00:04:59.320
and it just stays there
like a terrorist sleeper cell,

00:04:59.344 --> 00:05:01.468
waiting for instructions.